feat: Milestone 1 - Foundation

- Full project directory structure with .gitkeep placeholders
- backend/app/main.py: FastAPI skeleton with GET /health and CORS middleware
- backend/requirements.txt: fastapi, uvicorn, numpy, pandas, networkx, pydantic, httpx, pytest
- frontend: Vite + React 19 + Tailwind v4 scaffold
- frontend/src/App.jsx: home page fetches /api/health, renders live backend status
- Dark glassmorphism design with animated status indicator and feature cards
- .gitignore: Python + Node + OS artifacts
- .gitattributes: LF line-ending normalisation
- README.md: project summary, tech stack, local run instructions (no benchmark claims)
